<title>反驳中国AI主力造短剧 AI业者：数据不靠谱官媒：AI发展从未跑偏中国人工智能（AI）是否主要用于生成短剧，再惹争议。字</title>
<link>https://t.me/OutsightChina/10371</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://t.me/OutsightChina/10371</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 09:54:04 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div><div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto"><b>反驳中国AI主力造短剧 AI业者：数据不靠谱官媒：AI发展从未跑偏</b><br/><br/>中国人工智能（AI）是否主要用于生成短剧，再惹争议。字节跳动旗下AI助手“豆包”公关负责人，以及中国官媒近日先后发声反驳。<br/><br/>“豆包”公关负责人刘星和官媒针对有中国企业披露数据指，中国人工智能词元（Token）消耗55%用于短剧及视频生成，软件开发仅占15%，以及有自媒体对比中美数据，声称美国约58%的Token用于代码生成及企业自动化的说法作出回应。刘星质疑数据“不靠谱”，官媒强调，中国AI发展没有跑偏，无需崇洋媚外、妄自菲薄。<br/><br/>但台媒引述另一名中国AI业者称，据其了解，中国确实有超过50%的Token用于视频生成。<br/><br/><a href="?q=%23%E7%A7%91%E6%8A%80">#科技</a> <a href="?q=%23AI">#AI</a> <a href="?q=%23%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A">#企业</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%83%AD%E6%90%9C">#热搜</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%9C%8B%E9%89%B4">#看鉴</a><br/><br/><i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png')"><b>🔗</b></i>原文链接<br/><br/>《中央社》<a href="https://www.cna.com.tw/news/acn/202610200105.aspx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">报告：中国AI算力55%用在制作短剧及影音</a><br/>《星岛头条》<a href="https://www.stheadline.com/zh-hans/realtime-china/3627694/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">豆包反驳过半AI算力制爽剧 指母企仅用1成Token造片</a><br/>《人民日报》<a href="https://www.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_34286985" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">人民锐评：把“火药”做成“烟花”？警惕“中国AI跑偏论”</a><br/>《联合报》<a href="https://udn.com/news/story/7333/9824560" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">陆国内超半数算力造「爽剧」引热议陆业者：确实超50%用在图像生成</a></div><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/RCJ2ox566M9J8Y5PBb5oeIZ-9NKNgNJz5Rtkvx5fHpNy21sAvjaWHCxEgrzmIM0wkBoSWvlzWn1picyHCnRlLksJmdFkd-yTyQyKN3hB3_Oj60DO9-a4013odnCtWOKNQh54brUfXQtbnsTUJ66NMt3IR6rm3Lpa1hS_nUst2nYzaEBk_6ULF5Q8ko8HWwN9aRcRcjpvGHwoVP4yRf_1cRTFxZfyur9muFshGeeJGvIfDUnD2VBSKbhu4dyRnqhDR0_QhvtinCaymPIZPhgC4R47mcG2eOrA_vDFkNaz7YaKQAS_x5UIXzyUB5cSsp2nvLxfaIqq0kWQ58p1NtQUVA.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/RoHM6w33t1x8QvFjltiawsz1uyYsusONgYaMjvn6OxeNTVCHTE5PJRAmHW6fnU2I7Vmww8J2KdJVJh9s2wLGTJgxebdQPyZrAQ-Xn2xb_BagxfuvIJN4dK2J-T9eu1nClKxo_jsbY0lzfuQyBJVJZ9wP5TkkS-VVETaXS3tsu4sSWNifNhSRPDgGik1oVAq7Yvb5800gp41ALBz9AoKWua7acQQUP3ozSlzy_ia67bp9kngsbF3tFCEOHXwoFi1C3jYmqfB3NBARpWZeH9Z8_K9cTxjGlANfPYejL9Qaqwbpi6B_EYklS2PnZplsdSgcXFeU1NxkvVEBensWqLOLWQ.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/eupOM3yz2SoMMJYld1V74_MflfRQflr_CFwqGaVfyryi0Tzzc2C9fE3rJzPCL4suct1w4ZQIDElAM71FW-dxhdHqiN3pwNBd-Up6O8DIAqEo1IjMJKeEHKPISVQtAAGX7gbGPagEy8J6qQLT97QXO-r_nZ_cIFhPymnWPlXpYm45H8V0egvIBzSvDxttlO0l4St02H0z662978tSi0_AQcK69ws2By8ocdMI4EZ4YZ81G1xL5_NpjMwruf19KC6FMjd6k6aO4YE7kkmaNfFatxby0jNXTtkCGWVOQmKlkqxU0TUksnjntMMrl3vXkZKXcDu3hPJCPUhlyJOTIeWflg.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/jrLvFLY5hiiTu3bBv2b7vogCqpquz8yBwGS8HsbjR8xc_TdOhicWlaOFSxskxpMX01dkpcV_Wwnvf7y5H9OR2lIBLs_nKxZ8zWPZvWYIUhPZSjmqXWEyc2A-0Zfzoa0290MfGVRgjItK6MClTwScFwVc5LBKleDzSZyHIv5znT7peHMmhJo6StFEvJYnB_fDZnUqBJfVabSf4EYevwdj6wgZsLnxT6K8XHN-1WOVA9uJ9b6N8Hhdstn8p-AUL55sb-blsIzZ6rRKr7OcqLm3qHObl4hj6lqw9hc4KTqaoJVFm_6IBQRAmAQsRyPcpBMq3clUJlVIVrdkNkqmggQbrQ.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9881.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09FA4B7.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p>]]></description>
